title: Fernhill Yoke
designer: Wren Holloway
mode: round
weight: fingering
repeats: 12 around, 1 up
repeat: 1-24
url: https://wrenholloway.example/fernhill
note: Swatch a few rounds in the round before you start — stranded fabric pulls in at the colour changes. Keep floats loose by spreading the stitches on the right needle as you change colour, and catch the long one on the wrong side.
key:
  . MC  Oatmeal  #e8dfcd
  x CC1 Pine     #2e4b3c
  o CC2 Rust     #a8502e
  + CC3 Mustard  #c9962b
